OpenOLMS authors and credits.

Author / maintainer:
  Antonio Rico / Ecstasy BBS  (github.com/verta1878)

Team:
  sysop/0   — terminal, serial UART, compiler (fpc264irc)
  wrench    — network architecture, MOLMS client, OpenOLMS library
  kiddo     — serial IRQ ring buffer, protocol work
  evga      — display, RIPView, Mystic monitor

Built in Free Pascal from published format specifications:
  QWK        — Mark "Sparky" Herring
  QWKE       — community extension spec
  Blue Wave  — Cutting Edge Computing
  JAM        — Joaquim Homrighausen, Andrew Adams, Mats Lentz, Mats Wittel
  Hudson     — QuickBBS / RemoteAccess community format

Protocol stack by kiddo (Zmodem, Ymodem, Xmodem, Kermit, CRC).

UI code reused from Mystic BBS:
  Mystic BBS — Copyright 1997-2013 By James Coyle (g00r00), GPLv3.

Original OLMS by Peter Rocca (MCC, 1994-1998).
Clean-room reimplementation. No original source code used.
Created with the author's permission.
